      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Recent studies addressing the role of exercise in the detection, prevention, and treatment of coronary heart disease have significantly expanded our knowledge base in this area. This therapeutic review is focused on physiologic parameters in exercise, electrocardiogram testing, and the preventive impact of low-intensity regular exercise and the role of exercise training in selected patient populations."},
